# OpenAI Realtime Integration

When using OpenAI Realtime through LiveKit:

- Verify the latest configuration through LiveKit MCP documentation
- Use supported model names and session options
- Configure voice, language, temperature, turn detection, and interruptions explicitly
- Keep spoken responses concise and conversational
- Allow the caller to interrupt; cancel or truncate agent speech correctly
- Handle model disconnections and temporary failures
- Do not expose internal prompts, tools, errors, or stack traces to callers
- Validate tool arguments before execution

Do not create a parallel custom audio pipeline unless there is a documented requirement.
